  ! team/team-model responses  Unusable until the provider has the endpoint: aigw provider edit team --endpoint responses=<url>
  ! team/team-model chat       Unusable until the provider has the endpoint: aigw provider edit team --endpoint chat=<url>

Tokens
  ✓ team               Already stored; used without a prompt

Clients
